  "note": "Election of councillors for Newtownards Borough Council, 17 May 1961. Castle, Scrabo and Victoria Wards were returned unopposed; Glen Ward was contested (Rev. Albert H. M'Elroy against the sitting members Miss G. Foulis, W. M'Gimpsey and J. White) and its result was not found. The two sitting members with a newcomer, Alexander Bailie; there had been a vacancy in the ward during the previous month (Northern Whig). Returned unopposed."
